<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - March 20.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - March 20.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement in trading upto noon (0630 GMT) on Thursday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during this period and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The latest index was 3717.87, 28.80 points or 0.78 percent higher than Wednesday's close.</p>
